  answer: Patty Loveless
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Patty Loveless
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABTimber I'm Falling In Love\xBB, de 1988,
    y llega hasta 2001."
  - "Se mueve dentro de country; \xABYou Don't Even Know Who I Am\xBB refleja una
    energ\xEDa media y un pulso cercano a 132 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABHow Can I Help You Say Goodbye\xBB y \xABBlame
    It on Your Heart\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABSame Old Train\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABI Don't Need Your Rockin' Chair - Version
    w/special guests\xBB y \xABI Try to Think About Elvis\xBB."
